{
  "itemGroup.item_sink": "Create: Sink of Wares",
  "block.item_sink.item_sink": "Sink of Wares",
  "item_sink.ponder.item_sink_basics.header": "On the Use of the Sink of Wares",
  "item_sink.ponder.item_sink_basics.text_1": "This Sink doth turn unwanted wares to coin, one ware for every round of labour.",
  "item_sink.ponder.item_sink_basics.text_2": "With thy right button open the machine. Place a fitting ware within the inlet on the left.",
  "item_sink.ponder.item_sink_basics.text_3": "Only appointed wares whose coin is present may enter. In JEI, seek the recipes of the Sink's exchange.",
  "item_sink.ponder.item_sink_basics.text_4": "By custom, the Sink requires Forge Energy (FE) from a generator or battery. Power may enter on each side; its measure lies upon the left.",
  "item_sink.ponder.item_sink_basics.text_5": "The machine shines whilst it labours. The arrow fills as FE is spent. The worth of thy ware determines time and FE expense.",
  "item_sink.ponder.item_sink_basics.text_6": "Gather thy coin from the two outlets on the right. Each finished round consumes a single ware.",
  "item_sink.ponder.item_sink_basics.text_7": "The customary yield is coin of Create: Numismatics. Without Numismatics, set outputItem in item_sink-common.toml to a present ware, as minecraft:emerald.",
  "item_sink.ponder.item_sink_automation.header": "To Make the Sink Labour Unattended",
  "item_sink.ponder.item_sink_automation.text_1": "Let a hopper feed accepted wares. This chest and hopper fill the inlet from above.",
  "item_sink.ponder.item_sink_automation.text_2": "A second hopper bears the coin unto a chest. It draws from the two outlets alone; unworked wares remain within.",
  "item_sink.ponder.item_sink_automation.text_3": "Supply the machine with FE whilst it labours. Wares may enter, coin depart, and FE arrive upon each side.",
  "item_sink.ponder.item_sink_automation.text_4": "Labour ceases if the next payment hath no room, or FE is spent. Keep the outlets clear and grant the machine its power.",
  "item_sink.ponder.item_sink_automation.text_5": "When room for coin and sufficient FE return, the labour shall resume of its own accord.",
